    <statement><p>Find the cosine of the angle between the planes <m>x+y+z=0</m> and <m>2 x + 4 y + z = 1.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>\cos \theta =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{2+4+1}{\sqrt{3}\sqrt{2^{2}+4^{2}+1}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
